Package: fxmacrodata
Title: Client for the 'FXMacroData' API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("FXMacroData", email = "info@fxmacrodata.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Retrieve macroeconomic announcements with release timestamps,
    release calendars, FX reference rates, rate differentials, yield curves,
    COT positioning and commodity prices from the 'FXMacroData' API
    <https://fxmacrodata.com>. Series are returned as data frames. USD
    endpoints work without an API key.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/fxmacrodata/fxmacrodata-r, https://fxmacrodata.com/documentation/reference
BugReports: https://github.com/fxmacrodata/fxmacrodata-r/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
